    {
      "id": "TITLE538-02",
      "status": "verified-static",
      "conclusion": "Closure40b5c4 constructs HomeNavigationRoot from CodexNavigationView for layout values other than taskList. Layout detail or a nonnil parent dismiss removes openMenu and forwards dismiss. Standard with nil dismiss forwards openMenu and writes a nil dismiss function. The didReturnToTaskList callback presence becomes hasPresentingTaskList.",
