      "condition_audit": "CMP layout,#2 followed by CCMP dismiss,#0,#0,NE. If layout==2 the fallback NZCV is0, hence Z=0 and B.EQ is not taken. This corrects the interim message that wrongly stated detail forces dismiss nil."
